    "visual_review": "passed: Pass after independent inspection of the final raw card and all four rendered views. The repaired bunk rack posts connect both berth frames to the deck, ladder stiles connect the treads, and footrest legs visibly connect the plates to the deck. Muted ivory/teal fittings read coherently against the inherited Aurora shell. Six seats, the central aisle, cockpit access, galley, compact washroom and entry steps form a credible static arrangement. Full-size 1.9 m ME-008 guides fit the seats and two full-length berths without avatar shrinking or obvious body/furniture intersections in the reviewed views. The upper and lower bunks remain compact rotating-use berths, not six private sleeping quarters. Approval covers visual construction and static human-scale fit only; it does not certify engineering, animated boarding, pathfinding, onboard routines or runtime camera behavior. Database registration and runtime integration gates remain separate.",
    "deployed": false,
    "catalog_include": true,
    "visual_review_passed": true,
